---
source: tests/cli/help_snapshots_test.rs
expression: "help_output(&[subcommand, \"--help\"])"
---
Search workbook topics by title, text, or query selector.

Usage: xmind find [OPTIONS] <WORKBOOK>

Arguments:
  <WORKBOOK>  Path to the .xmind workbook

Options:
      --title <TITLE>
          Match an exact topic title
      --title-contains <TITLE_CONTAINS>
          Match topics whose title contains this text
      --contains <CONTAINS>
          Match topics whose searchable content contains this text
      --query <QUERY>
          Run a query selector expression
      --limit <LIMIT>
          Maximum number of matches to return
      --offset <OFFSET>
          Skip this many matches before returning results
      --json
          Emit a JSON command envelope
      --format <FORMAT>
          Select the human or machine-readable output format [default: text] [possible values: text, json, compact-json, markdown, outline, assets]
      --fields <FIELDS>
          Limit JSON output to comma-separated field paths
      --quiet
          Suppress non-essential text output
      --no-color
          Disable ANSI color in text output
      --sheet <SHEET>
          Select a sheet by title
      --sheet-id <SHEET_ID>
          Select a sheet by stable id
      --sheet-index <SHEET_INDEX>
          Select a sheet by zero-based index
  -h, --help
          Print help

Examples:
  xmind find roadmap.xmind --title "Launch"
  xmind find roadmap.xmind --query 'title contains "Launch"' --limit 5
